        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>You really need to judge the experience level of the players you are playing with. If they are all new players, do not do Kargra Warfang, it is just too much. Baron Blade in Insula Primalis remains a good introductory villain, if you are not sick of him.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>I'd also encourage you to look around at the con! There's bound to be lots of interesting stuff going on.</p>",
